{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34317","headline":"和张广文贲旅泊吴门次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和张广文贲旅泊吴门次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高秋能叩触，天籁忽成文。\n苦调虽潜倚，灵音自绝羣。\n茅峰曾醮斗，笠泽久眠云。\n许伴山中躅，三年任一醺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}